{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0001", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4133, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "25743130", "baseline_text": "%t10", "kind": "ascr", "source": "%t10", "pointer_offset": 3896, "unit": "dialogue:a00cbea9173d423c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0002", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4138, "capacity": 10, "raw_hex": "f28dfb68f283f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "얼른 놀자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はやく遊ぼうよー！", "pointer_offset": 3900, "unit": "dialogue:2eae2f5ee6860d0c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0003", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 5172, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f8b2f0bcf0d7f0b9f147f15781432f2ff99cf64cf1442f2ff1acf25af8aaf64cf944f243f95af154f0cff1688144", "baseline_text": "이 시합에서는，//내 패가//보너스 패가 되어 있다구．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "この試合では、//ボクのパイが//ボーナスパイになってるんだよ。", "pointer_offset": 3904, "unit": "dialogue:f2b75719b03abaa5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0004", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4218, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0b2fa48f1e2f0dff957f0b2f1c8f14881442f2ff8b2f140f0b9f1478143f15af8bdf9a9f1d5f0d2f0e72f2ff1e1f3c1f2658144", "baseline_text": "이번 주제는 이거야．//이 중에서，어느 한 세트를//맞춰줘．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今回のお題はこれだよ。//この中の、どれか１組を//そろえてね。", "pointer_offset": 3908, "unit": "dialogue:30534c017460121b", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0005", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 5219, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f1cff0af81b82f2ff19cf944f5f3f0c7f0f081b8", "baseline_text": "좋아∈//내가 딜러네∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よーし！//ボクが親だね∈", "pointer_offset": 3912, "unit": "dialogue:4f5dbe625c5db885", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0006", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 5240, "capacity": 28, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f15781432f2ff0b2f1d9f0a3f944f5f3f0c7f14881b8", "baseline_text": "이번에는，//이치로가 딜러야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は、//イチローが親だよ！", "pointer_offset": 3916, "unit": "dialogue:703ff64047347294", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0007", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4333, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f14bf39af0cf816081b82f2ff0b18143f0b2f3bbf15a816081b8", "baseline_text": "해냈다～∈//나，이겼어～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "やった～！//ボク、勝っちゃったーっ∈", "pointer_offset": 3920, "unit": "dialogue:f40d9190b7ae8bb6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0008", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4370, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f14ef17bf9d4f2b8f0a5f9c7f25df157f18df7d1", "baseline_text": "조금만 더하면 됐는데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もうちょっとだったのに……", "pointer_offset": 3924, "unit": "dialogue:537f0f6d52d04d2c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0009", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4397, "capacity": 22, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f957f0a4f8a4f287f8c8f1c8f14881b8", "baseline_text": "이번에는 지지 않을 거야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は負けないからね！", "pointer_offset": 3928, "unit": "dialogue:6b199eab86b476c8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0010", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4420, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f0af81608143f1c3f1c8f3d2f15a81442f2ffbf4f283f0fa8143f0b2f1d9f0a38144", "baseline_text": "아～，즐거웠어．//또 놀자，이치로．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "あー、楽しかった。//また遊ぼうよ、イチロー。", "pointer_offset": 3932, "unit": "dialogue:b59f1633619b4ada", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0011", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4465, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0cffac3f0e2f9f7f26af0e2f15781432f2ff0b1f1acf8cff2ddfa57f1c8f14881442f2ff484f19c81b8", "baseline_text": "다음 대전 상대는，//나보다 강할 거야．//힘내∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "次の対戦相手は、//ボクよりも強いよ。//がんばってね！", "pointer_offset": 3936, "unit": "dialogue:0d9668121efd8dea", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0012", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4518, "capacity": 18, "raw_hex": "f2b5f25af2a9f0d2f944f3a1f259f8c8f16e", "baseline_text": "토너먼트가 끝났을 때", "kind": "ascr", "source": "勝ち抜き戦が終わった時", "pointer_offset": 3940, "unit": "dialogue:bb0e5833a13689be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0013", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4541, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "f491f0a5f186f469f0b8f0cf8144", "baseline_text": "축하드립니다．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "おめでとうございます。", "pointer_offset": 3944, "unit": "dialogue:b84710c5e1d20d4f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0014", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4564, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f154f276f0af8143f0b2f1d9f0a381432f2ff9a9fa48fab8f283f984f2bff0f3f18df7d12f2ff991f298f2618148", "baseline_text": "있잖아，이치로，//한 번 더 놀고 싶은데…//안 될까？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ねぇ、イチロー、//もう１回遊びたいんだけど……//だめかな？", "pointer_offset": 3948, "unit": "dialogue:70ca22bd0e9c7df9", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0015", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4623, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f1d78160f0b281b82f2ff0b18143f36bf36cf8b6f257f0f181b82f2ff199f199f94bf1e2f957fa8af991f26781b8", "baseline_text": "와～이∈//나，열심히 할게∈//살살해 주는 건 안 돼∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わ～い。//ボク、がんばるよ！//手加減しちゃダメだからね∈", "pointer_offset": 3952, "unit": "dialogue:6ffc0c0c86306783", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0016", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4680, "capacity": 32, "raw_hex": "f0d8f27ef168f0b1f7d12f2ff0d8f2ca8143f0cff2c3f8b9fbf4f283f0fa81b8", "baseline_text": "그렇구나…//그럼，다음에 또 놀자∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そっか……//じゃ、また今度遊ぼうね！", "pointer_offset": 3956, "unit": "dialogue:479fd543fa1f79ca", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0017", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4717, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f14bf39af0cf816081b82f2ff0b18143f0b2f3bbf15a816081b8", "baseline_text": "해냈다～∈//나，이겼어～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "やった～！//ボク、勝っちゃったーっ∈", "pointer_offset": 3960, "unit": "dialogue:f40d9190b7ae8bb6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0018", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 4754, "capacity": 20, "raw_hex": "f14ef17bf9d4f2b8f0a5f9c7f25df157f18df7d1", "baseline_text": "조금만 더하면 됐는데…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "もうちょっとだったのに……", "pointer_offset": 3964, "unit": "dialogue:537f0f6d52d04d2c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN#0019", "file": "MINIGAME/JT10COQU.SBN", "offset": 5147, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0b2f248f0b9f957f0a4f8a4f287f8c8f1c8f0b8f26181b8", "baseline_text": "이번에는 지지 않을 거니까∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "今度は負けないからね！", "pointer_offset": 3968, "unit": "dialogue:6b199eab86b476c8", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
